# TIER 1 - saddle-point refinement from a CURATED seed geometry (local laptop)
# Use this after first-pass NEB paths show artifact barriers.
# Start directly from the curated seed (xyz_seeds/V-TSn_start.xyz), NOT from a
# raw NEB peak frame. Calc_Hess builds the initial Hessian; the run must end
# with exactly ONE imaginary frequency, verified by the FREQ keyword here.

! XTB2 OPTTS FREQ

%geom
  Calc_Hess true
  MaxIter 200
end

%pal nprocs 3 end

* xyzfile 0 1 ../xyz_seeds/V-TS1_start.xyz

# After convergence:
#   1) confirm the single imaginary mode animates along the reacting bonds;
#   2) displace the saddle +-0.01 nm along that mode (both signs);
#   3) optimize both displaced structures; they must fall into the intended
#      reactant and product of the step;
#   4) only then record the barrier in the register.
